      "worked_solution": "To find the coordinates of $Q,$ we start at the origin, move $2$ units *left*, and then $4$ units *up*. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/2c6371205aa6447e61b6dd675f84df2acb68c3734576b59752b059d338a0b8b4.png)\n\nThe coordinates of $Q$ are $(-2,4).$ Therefore, the $x$-coordinate of $Q$ is $-2.$",
