      "worked_solution": "We label the quadrants as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/8bf613f97377445509093c8ea16f2478ac834a0cad3bddbaf5a3428e51238f6a.png)\n\nSince $P$ is placed above and to the left of the origin, it lies in quadrant $\\text{II},$ which is the second quadrant.",
