      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/697a2ef3438aaea021f0886e1172019744c643acc4195daf126e6f64d0a77917.png)\n\nA point $T$ is shown on the axis above. To which quadrant does it belong?",
      "worked_solution": "We label the quadrants as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/41a419063ce1bc160023de139406c6ed8f66ab4f7046f223386fc5d93dd60292.png)\n\nSince $T$ is placed below and to the right of the origin, it lies in quadrant $\\text{IV},$ which is the fourth quadrant.",
